        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Correspondingly, we have implemented a robust capital allocation strategy directed at responsibly developing our assets and positioning us for organic growth, while also returning capital to our shareholders through a combination of debt retirements, a base dividend and opportunistic share repurchases.",
